# Pin line endings so a checkout is byte-identical on every machine.
#
# The index stores LF, but without this file Git converts to CRLF on checkout when core.autocrlf is
# true (the Windows default), and gofmt then reports every Go file as unformatted. Verification that
# depends on formatted output must not depend on a developer's Git configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be line-ending normalised.
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
